    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerekekhera liliicha lio Mwami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayefwe, se silikhoo sikila khumuandikile enywe, khuloondekhana ne biise nibio bibiindu bino bikhekholekhelemo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 24.43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 12.39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.3.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet. 3.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila enywe mwabene mumanyile bulayi bwene muli Endaalo yo Mwami ekheeche butundubikha nga omwifwi ne echa mu silo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu nga bakhabe ne balikho baloma bali, “Luno khuli ne kumuleembe, butinyu mbakhoo tawe” khane siise esio nisio lilionaka lilikho libanyoola! Liliicha khangu busa nga khulumwa khwo mukhasi ne enya khusaala, mala babaandu se baliebachakho tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne enywe bawandaayefwe, se muli mu siilima tawe, Endaalo eyo se khoya yamutundubikha nga omwifwi ne atundubikha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enywe mweesi muli babaandu be mu buwaanga, be kumuusi. Se khuli be siilo namwe be sisiilima tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako, se khukhoyeele khwakona nga babaandi tawe, khukhoya khube meso lundi milengaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bakonaanga siilo, lundi bameelanga siilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.59.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 59.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.6.13+EPH.6.14+EPH.6.15+EPH.6.16+EPH.6.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Baef. 6.13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne efwe khuli be kumuusi khwako khukhoyeele khwaba milengaala. Khukhwola khwifware lisuubila ne busiime nga engabo eteecha sifuba, ne lilieyikina lie buonia nga ekofio eye sichuuma ekisa kumurwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele se akhurobora efwe khuukuumwe mu lirima liewe tawe, ne kakhali khunyoole buonia khubirira mu Mwami wefwe Yesu Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owakhufwiila efwe nio khwole khumenya alala ne naye nga ne akheeche akhunyoole balamu namwe bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, khemuchuubane ne khuyeetana mwabeene ne mwabeene, nga luno ne mulakholanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liliekisia limaliilisi ne kimileembe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumusaba enywe, bawandaayefwe, mube ne buuri khwaabo bakhola kimilimo mwinywe, bamurangirira ne bamwekisia enywe mu liimenya lie Bukristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baelesie liria likali ne busiime sikila kimilimo nikio bakhola. Ba ne kumuleembe khu mwabeene ne mwabeene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumuchuuba enywe, bawandaayefwe, kaambila bakara. Tasa kamaani baari, yeeta batekhele, mala mube ne khukhwefwiilisia khu buli sia mulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola muli omundu yesi yesi se aruungia kamabi khu mabi tawe, ne buli lwoosi yeluungikha khukhola kamalayi khu buli mundu ne khu baandu boosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekhoya buli lwoosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "saba biise bioosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ba mumupa orio mu buli siindu siosi siosi. Sikila lino lili lilienya lia Wele mu Yesu Kristo khwinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhasimia Roho Omutakatifu tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukhalekelesia burume bwe bung'oosi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali ra buli siindu khwikela. Tililila siili silayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yebacha buli bubwafuma bumayaanu bwoosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele okhuelesianga efwe kumuleembe, akhoya amukhola enywe mwaba batakatifu mu buli ngila, mala aliinde roho, kumwoyo, ne kumubili, bilobe khubakho ne bubi bwosi bwosi khu ndaalo niyo Omwami wefwe Yesu Kristo akheechelekho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo omulaanganga enywe akhakhole ario, sikila ali omusuubilwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayefwe, khusabilekho akhaba fweesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
